gory Academia Posting Date 10/06/2026, 10:34 PM Apply Before 10/25/2026, 05:55 AM Job Schedule Full time Locations Civic Place, Liverpool, NSW, 2170, AU © MapTiler © OpenStreetMap contributors Legend Jobs at a location Group of locations © MapTiler © OpenStreetMap contributors | © Oracle Corporation Terms Legal Notices Use command and scroll to zoom the map Use two fingers to move the map Civic Place, Liverpool, NSW, 2170, AU Copy to Clipboard Similar Jobs Lecturer Wollongong, NSW, Australia Posted on 09/24/2026 School of Nursing | Faculty of Science, Medicine and Health\n\nContribute to world-class teaching and impactful research through the delivery of undergraduate and postgraduate nursing education, innovative research, and meaningful industry and community engagement. See More Jobs Contact Us Feedback Privacy Statement and Policies Contact Us Feedback Privacy Statement and Policies UOW Home Page Why work at UOW UOW Global Presence UOW in Dubai UOW in Hong Kong UOW in Malaysia Our People UOW Pulse I am an employee Are You Still With Us? It seems you've been gone for a while. For security reasons we will end your session automatically in 03:00 unless you would like to continue working. End Session Continue Working Work Summary This summary is generated by AI Assist. Click inside the summary text box to make changes as necessary. 1000 Required Discard Add Summary Page Associate Lecturer - University of Wollongong Careers loaded"
